Third-party code
----------------

The provider layer in bin/omani-provider is derived from ani-cli:

    https://github.com/pystardust/ani-cli
    Copyright (C) pystardust and ani-cli contributors
    GPL-3.0-or-later

Specifically, the request handling, the search and episode-list scraping, the
base64+XOR deobfuscation of the embed payload, the m3u8 resolution and the
quality selection follow ani-cli's implementation. Omani is therefore a
derivative work and carries the same license.
